EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
This unified proposal packages all six individual contributions into a single 
coherent architecture: the AEGENTIS Cognitive Runtime as an overlay layer 
across Flipper One's entire stack. Rather than six isolated contributions, this 
is one integrated system where each component reinforces the others.

