VALUE PROPOSITION:
No other contributor brings an autonomous cognitive layer to Flipper One. 
This is not a feature — it is a runtime substrate that makes the device 
self-aware, self-healing, and self-orchestrating across hardware, firmware, 
Linux, UI, and testing domains.

